Usage: sanitize_published.py HOOK_DIR REVIEW_SETS_JSON SRC_ROOT DEST_ROOT [FOLDER...]
Reads SRC_ROOT/<folder>/transcript.{jsonl,md} byte-exactly and writes changed files to DEST_ROOT (which may
equal SRC_ROOT). Only records that change are re-serialized; transcript.md is re-rendered with the hook's
render_markdown, its header counting the new markers. Prints counts only.
